"800I A2（64GB × 8）节点 | [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8)    |"

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800I A3 (128GB × 8). The example uses two physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）上部署一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode "
"池的示例。该示例为每个池使用两个物理节点。"

msgid ""
"Use the official `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` checkpoint on all nodes. It "
"includes the DSpark draft weights, so no separate draft-model path is "
"required. Replace the model path, IP addresses, and network interface names "
"below with your environment's values."
msgstr ""
"在所有节点上使用官方 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` 权重。该权重已包含 DSpark "
"草稿权重，因此无需单独的草稿模型路径。请将下方的模型路径、IP 地址和网络接口名称替换为您环境中的实际值。"

msgid "1. Prepare `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node."
msgstr "1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备 `launch_online_dp.py`。"

msgid ""
"    |`--pcp-size`|int|No|1|Prefill context parallel size within each DP "
"rank; passed as `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` to `--prefill-context-parallel-size`. Each"
" local DP instance uses `TP × PCP` devices.|"
msgstr ""
"    |`--pcp-size`|int|否|1|每个 DP rank 内的 Prefill 上下文并行大小；以 `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` "
"的形式传递给 `--prefill-context-parallel-size`。每个本地 DP 实例使用 `TP × PCP` 个设备。|"

msgid ""
"    |`--dp-rpc-port`|str|No|12321|RPC port for data parallel master "
"communication.|"
msgstr "    |`--dp-rpc-port`|str|否|12321|用于数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。|"

msgid ""
"    |`--vllm-start-port`|int|No|7100|Starting port for each vLLM engine "
"instance on this node.|"
msgstr "    |`--vllm-start-port`|int|否|7100|该节点上每个 vLLM 引擎实例的起始端口。|"

msgid "2. Prepare `run_prefill.sh` on both Prefill nodes."
msgstr "2. 在两个 Prefill 节点上准备 `run_prefill.sh`。"

msgid ""
"Set `local_ip` to the current node's communication IP and `MASTER_ADDR` to "
"Prefill node 0's communication IP on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"在两个节点上，将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的通信 IP，将 `MASTER_ADDR` 设置为 Prefill 节点 0 的通信 IP。"

msgid ""
"3. Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on both Decode nodes, in the same directory "
"as `launch_online_dp.py`."
msgstr ""
"3. 在两个 Decode 节点上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`，并将其放在与 `launch_online_dp.py` "
"相同的目录中。"

msgid ""
"Set `local_ip` and `nic_name` separately on each node. The launcher supplies"
" the visible devices, service port, and parallel parameters."
msgstr "在每个节点上分别设置 `local_ip` 和 `nic_name`。启动器会提供可见设备、服务端口和并行参数。"

msgid ""
"4. Start the two Prefill nodes and two Decode nodes in separate terminals on"
" the corresponding machines."
msgstr "4. 在对应机器上的独立终端中分别启动两个 Prefill 节点和两个 Decode 节点。"

msgid "5. Deploy the P-D disaggregation proxy."
msgstr "5. 部署 P-D 分离代理。"

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8). The example uses four physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）上部署一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode 池的示例。该示例为每个池使用四个物理节点。"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` allows the model repository's custom code to be loaded. Only use trusted model repositories.\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` configures prefill context parallelism (PCP) on Model Runner V2 (MRv2), replacing the DSA-CP configuration used on MRv1. The A3 DSpark example uses PCP size `8` on Prefill and `1` on Decode (`1` disables PCP). The Decode launcher passes `--pcp-size` through `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` to this option. Keep `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pcp_size` and `decode.pcp_size` consistent with the PCP size of the corresponding pool.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` configures KV cache transfer between the prefill producer and decode consumer in PD separation.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP, TP, PCP and DCP layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"- `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`: enables the Fused MC2 fusion operator to accelerate communication on Prefill nodes (A3 series).\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the Decode node is insufficient, requests are sent to Prefill for KV Cache recomputation. Enable it only on PD Decode nodes; the legacy top-level key is deprecated.\n"
"- `--speculative-config`: Prefill and Decode must use the same DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` value. Use the value declared by the checkpoint; this example uses `5`. The nested `enforce_eager` applies to DSpark draft execution, while the top-level `--enforce-eager` keeps the Prefill target model in eager mode.\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2`: required for KV cache transfer when pipeline parallelism (PP) is enabled in this deployment. The A3 example enables PP on Prefill (`--pipeline-parallel-size 2`), so it uses `MooncakeConnectorV2` instead of the previously used `MooncakeHybridConnector`."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则服务可能在启动期间发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 强制 prefill 节点使用 eager 执行而非图编译。\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` 允许加载模型仓库中的自定义代码。请仅使用可信的模型仓库。\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 在 Model Runner V2（MRv2）上配置 prefill 上下文并行（PCP），替代 MRv1 上使用的 DSA-CP 配置。A3 DSpark 示例在 Prefill 上使用 PCP 大小 `8`，在 Decode 上使用 `1`（`1` 表示禁用 PCP）。Decode 启动器通过 `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` 将 `--pcp-size` 传递给该选项。请保持 `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pcp_size` 和 `decode.pcp_size` 与对应池的 PCP 大小一致。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 配置 PD 分离中 prefill 生产者与 decode 消费者之间的 KV cache 传输。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 侧和 decode 侧实际的全局 DP、TP、PCP 和 DCP 布局一致。\n"
"- `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`：启用 Fused MC2 融合算子以加速 Prefill 节点（A3 系列）上的通信。\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 Decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求会被发送到 Prefill 进行 KV Cache 重计算。仅在 PD Decode 节点上启用；旧版顶层键已弃用。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`：Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的 DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` 值。请使用权重中声明的值；本示例使用 `5`。嵌套的 `enforce_eager` 作用于 DSpark 草稿执行，而顶层的 `--enforce-eager` 使 Prefill 目标模型保持 eager 模式。\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2`：当此部署启用流水线并行（PP）时，KV cache 传输需要此连接器。A3 示例在 Prefill 上启用了 PP（`--pipeline-parallel-size 2`），因此使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 而非之前使用的 `MooncakeHybridConnector`。"

msgid ""
"| Long Context (~1M Input, Reference) | 1P1D deployment (2 Prefill + 2 "
"Decode A3 nodes) | 64 (A3) | DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | For this separate "
"long-context reference, use DP2/TP16 on both sides, reduce both sides to 2 "
"sequences, and reduce Decode batched tokens to 16 to reserve memory for a "
"1M-token context. |"
msgstr ""
"| 长上下文（约 1M 输入，参考） | 1P1D 部署（2 个 Prefill + 2 个 Decode A3 节点） | 64（A3） | "
"DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | 对于此单独的长上下文参考配置，两侧均使用 DP2/TP16，将两侧序列数均减少到 2，并将 "
"Decode 批处理 token 数减少到 16，以便为 1M token 上下文预留内存。 |"

