msgid ""
"- For Ascend 950DT products, use the original "
"[`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-"
"ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813) weights released by DeepSeek on Hugging Face. The "
