msgstr ""
"A2/A3 示例假设模型权重存储在 `/root/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/vllm-ascend/` 中。Ascend"
" 950DT系列产品的示例使用位于 `/root/.cache/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 的原始 "
"`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` Hugging Face 权重。可根据实际环境修改这些路径。"

msgid ""
"The quantized model `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-w4a8-mtp` requires at least 2 Atlas "
"800I A3 (128GB × 8) nodes or 4 Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8) nodes. The Ascend "
"950DT mixed-deployment example uses 2 nodes (96GB × 8) with the original "
"Hugging Face weights. Run the following scripts on each node respectively."
msgstr ""
"量化模型 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-w4a8-mtp` 至少需要 2 个 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）节点或 4 个 "
"Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）节点。Ascend 950DT 混合部署示例使用 2 个节点（96GB × 8）及原始 Hugging "
"Face 权重。请分别在各节点上运行以下脚本。"

msgid "=== \"950DT products with DSpark\""
msgstr "=== \"使用 DSpark 的 Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid ""
"Use the original `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint on both nodes. Set "
"`node0_ip` to the service IP of Node0 on both nodes. Each node hosts one DP "
"rank whose 8 NPUs run prefill context parallel (PCP8), so the engine uses "
"`DP2/TP1` with `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`."
msgstr ""
"两个节点均使用原始 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 权重文件。在两个节点上均将 `node0_ip` 设置为 Node0 的服务 "
"IP。每个节点承载一个 DP rank，其 8 个 NPU 运行 prefill 上下文并行（PCP8），因此引擎使用 `DP2/TP1` 并设置 "
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`。"

msgid ""
"Use the same environment variables as Node0, with the following DP changes "
"(start rank 1 and `--headless`):"
msgstr "使用与 Node0 相同的环境变量，并进行以下 DP 更改（起始 rank 为 1 且使用 `--headless`）："

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, and `--data-parallel-size-local` sets the number of DP ranks on the current node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank` specifies the starting data parallel rank of the current node. Set a unique value on each headless node (e.g., Node1 = 1). On Node0, omit `--data-parallel-start-rank` even when the start rank is 0, to avoid enabling hybrid load balancing with headless remote engines.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` specifies the IP address of the data parallel master node (Node0). It must be consistent across all nodes.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all nodes and ensure the port is available.\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. Configure it together with the DP sizes according to the deployment topology and available NPUs.\n"
"- On 950DT products, DeepSeek-V4 does not currently support standalone tensor parallelism (TP-only). TP partitions only the `wq_b`, `wo_a`, and `wo_b` linear layers, so data parallelism is recommended. For long-context prefill, the examples for 950DT products combine `DP2/TP1` with `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`, which spreads the prompt across the 8 NPUs of each DP rank. Do not combine it with `enable_dsa_cp`, which is mutually exclusive with prefill context parallelism and unsupported by the V2 model runner.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--headless` (used on non-master nodes) disables the API server on the node, since only the master node serves requests.\n"
"- `--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length. Adjust it according to your actual scenario.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`, `--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, and `--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4` enable the DeepSeek-V4 tokenizer behavior, automatic tool calling, and reasoning-output parsing.\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To enable it, remove this option.\n"
"- `--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4k prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W4A8 model used in the A2 and A3 configurations. The original DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 weights used on 950DT products do not require this option.\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'` selects the multi-thread weight iterator. `enable_multithread_load` must be a JSON boolean and `num_threads` must be a positive integer.\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` is an alternative that warms checkpoint files into the OS page cache before the normal iterator loads them. Do not combine it with multi-thread loading: the default loader rejects `prefetch`, `eager`, or `torchao` when `enable_multithread_load` is `true`. The examples in this document use only multi-thread loading.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` configures speculative decoding. Use `mtp` for the preview MTP checkpoint and `dspark` for the `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint. For DSpark, use the value declared by the checkpoint; the example uses 5 speculative tokens, and all ranks must use the same value.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency.\n"
"- `--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. `enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, `enable_shared_expert_dp` enables data parallelism for shared experts, and `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput. `enable_fused_mc2: 0` disables the Fused MC2 dispatch/combine path.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096` retains prefix-cache checkpoints every 4096 tokens. It takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled and must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; `4096` matches the DSpark example's block size of `32`."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行 rank 数量，`--data-parallel-size-local` 设置当前节点上的 DP rank 数量。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank` 指定当前节点的起始数据并行 rank。请在每个 headless 节点上设置唯一的值（例如 Node1 = 1）。在 Node0 上，即使起始 rank 为 0，也应省略 `--data-parallel-start-rank`，以避免启用与 headless 远程引擎的混合负载均衡。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` 指定数据并行主节点（Node0）的 IP 地址。所有节点上的该值必须保持一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 是 DP RPC 端口。所有节点使用相同的值，并确保该端口可用。\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size` 设置每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。请根据部署拓扑和可用 NPU 将其与 DP 大小一起配置。\n"
"- 在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，DeepSeek-V4 目前不支持独立的张量并行（仅 TP）。TP 仅对 `wq_b`、`wo_a` 和 `wo_b` 线性层进行切分，因此推荐使用数据并行。对于长上下文 prefill，Ascend 950DT系列产品的示例将 `DP2/TP1` 与 `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` 结合使用，从而将 prompt 分散到每个 DP rank 的 8 个 NPU 上。请勿将其与 `enable_dsa_cp` 结合使用，后者与 prefill 上下文并行互斥，且 V2 模型运行器不支持。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。请勿在同一 MoE 层中混用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--headless`（用于非主节点）禁用该节点上的 API 服务器，因为只有主节点处理请求。\n"
"- `--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度。请根据实际场景进行调整。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 表示每个 DP 组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，超出的请求将保持等待状态且不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入 TTFT 和 TPOT 等指标。因此，在测试性能时，通常建议 `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单次调度器步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill 效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`、`--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice` 和 `--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4` 启用 DeepSeek-V4 的 tokenizer 行为、自动工具调用和推理输出解析。\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。要启用它，请移除此选项。\n"
"- `--block-size` 设置 KV 缓存块大小。要启用实验性的 4k 前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从 `128` 改为 `32`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为 A2 和 A3 配置中使用的 W4A8 模型启用昇腾量化。Ascend 950DT系列产品上使用的原始 DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 权重不需要此选项。\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'` 选择多线程权重迭代器。`enable_multithread_load` 必须是 JSON 布尔值，`num_threads` 必须是正整数。\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` 是一种替代方案，它在常规迭代器加载检查点文件之前将其预热到操作系统页缓存中。请勿将其与多线程加载结合使用：当 `enable_multithread_load` 为 `true` 时，默认加载器会拒绝 `prefetch`、`eager` 或 `torchao`。本文档中的示例仅使用多线程加载。\n"
"- `--speculative-config` 配置投机解码。对于预览版 MTP 检查点使用 `mtp`，对于 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 检查点使用 `dspark`。对于 DSpark，请使用检查点声明的值；示例使用 5 个投机 token，且所有 rank 必须使用相同的值。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 在 decode 阶段启用完整的 ACL graph 执行，以降低调度延迟。\n"
"- `--additional-config` 启用昇腾特有的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL graph 执行，`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持静态内核编译禁用，`enable_cpu_binding` 启用昇腾原生 CPU 绑定，`enable_shared_expert_dp` 为共享专家启用数据并行，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算以获得更好的 MoE 吞吐量。`enable_fused_mc2: 0` 禁用 Fused MC2 dispatch/combine 路径。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096` 每 4096 个 token 保留一次前缀缓存检查点。它仅在启用前缀缓存时生效，且必须是 `--block-size` 的非负倍数；`4096` 与 DSpark 示例的块大小 `32` 相匹配。"

msgid ""
"The following sections describe PD separation deployment on Atlas 800I A3 "
"nodes (128GB × 8), Atlas 800I A2 nodes (64GB × 8), and Ascend 950DT nodes "
"(96GB × 8)."
msgstr ""
"以下各节介绍在 Atlas 800I A3 节点（128GB × 8）、Atlas 800I A2 节点（64GB × 8）和昇腾 950DT "
"节点（96GB × 8）上的 PD 分离部署。"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` allows the model repository's custom code to be loaded. Only use trusted model repositories.\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` configures prefill context parallelism (PCP) on Model Runner V2 (MRv2). The A3 DSpark example uses PCP size `8` on Prefill and `1` on Decode (`1` disables PCP). The Decode launcher passes `--pcp-size` through `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` to this option.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` configures KV cache transfer between the prefill producer and decode consumer in PD separation.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"- `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`: enables the Fused MC2 fusion operator to accelerate communication on Prefill nodes (A3 series).\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the Decode node is insufficient, requests are sent to Prefill for KV Cache recomputation. Enable it only on PD Decode nodes; the legacy top-level key is deprecated.\n"
"- `--speculative-config`: Prefill and Decode must use the same DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` value. Use the value declared by the checkpoint; this example uses `7`. The nested `enforce_eager` applies to DSpark draft execution, while the top-level `--enforce-eager` keeps the Prefill target model in eager mode.\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2`: required for KV cache transfer when pipeline parallelism (PP) is enabled in this deployment. The A3 example enables PP on Prefill (`--pipeline-parallel-size 2`), so it uses `MooncakeConnectorV2` instead of the previously used `MooncakeHybridConnector`."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器处于启用状态。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动时可能发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 强制 Prefill 节点使用 eager 执行模式，而非图编译模式。\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` 允许加载模型仓库中的自定义代码。请仅使用可信的模型仓库。\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 在 Model Runner V2 (MRv2) 上配置 Prefill 上下文并行 (PCP)。A3 DSpark 示例在 Prefill 上使用 PCP 大小 `8`，在 Decode 上使用 `1`（`1` 表示禁用 PCP）。Decode 启动器通过 `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` 将此选项传递给 `--pcp-size`。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 在 PD 分离中配置 Prefill 生产者与 Decode 消费者之间的 KV cache 传输。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 Prefill 侧和 Decode 侧实际的全局 DP 和 TP 布局相匹配。\n"
"- `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`：启用 Fused MC2 融合算子，以加速 Prefill 节点（A3 系列）上的通信。\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 Decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求会被发送到 Prefill 进行 KV Cache 重计算。仅在 PD Decode 节点上启用；旧版顶层键已弃用。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`：Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的 DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` 值。请使用 checkpoint 声明的值；本示例使用 `7`。嵌套的 `enforce_eager` 作用于 DSpark draft 执行，而顶层的 `--enforce-eager` 使 Prefill 目标模型保持 eager 模式。\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2`：当此部署启用流水线并行 (PP) 时，KV cache 传输需要此连接器。A3 示例在 Prefill 上启用了 PP（`--pipeline-parallel-size 2`），因此使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2`，而非之前使用的 `MooncakeHybridConnector`。"

msgid "#### 5.2.3 950DT products PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.3 Ascend 950DT系列产品 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"This section shows a 2P1D deployment on 8 Ascend 950DT nodes (96GB × 8) with"
" the `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint. The Prefill side (2P) runs 2 Prefill"
" instances, and each instance is a single logical engine with `DP1/TP1/PP2` "
"plus `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` spread over 2 nodes (`--nnodes 2`):"
" one PP stage runs on each node. The Decode side (1D) uses 4 nodes as one "
"Decode pool containing 32 DP ranks with the `DP32/TP1` configuration, and "
"each Decode node starts 8 local DP ranks. Each Prefill instance declares "
"`\"prefill\": {\"dp_size\": 1, \"tp_size\": 1, \"pp_size\": 2, "
"\"pp_layer_partition\": \"32,29\"}` in `--kv-transfer-config`, while the "
"Decode side declares `\"decode\": {\"dp_size\": 32, \"tp_size\": 1}`. Assign"
" a unique `kv_port` to every Prefill instance and to the Decode pool."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在 8 个昇腾 950DT 节点（96GB × 8）上使用 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint 的 2P1D "
"部署。Prefill 侧（2P）运行 2 个 Prefill 实例，每个实例是一个单一的逻辑引擎，采用 `DP1/TP1/PP2` 配置并加上 "
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`，跨 2 个节点（`--nnodes 2`）分布：每个节点运行一个 PP "
"stage。Decode 侧（1D）使用 4 个节点作为一个 Decode pool，包含 32 个 DP rank，采用 `DP32/TP1` "
"配置，每个 Decode 节点启动 8 个本地 DP rank。每个 Prefill 实例在 `--kv-transfer-config` 中声明 "
"`\"prefill\": {\"dp_size\": 1, \"tp_size\": 1, \"pp_size\": 2, "
"\"pp_layer_partition\": \"32,29\"}`，而 Decode 侧声明 `\"decode\": {\"dp_size\": "
"32, \"tp_size\": 1}`。请为每个 Prefill 实例和 Decode pool 分配唯一的 `kv_port`。"

msgid ""
"Before you start, set `nic_name` and `local_ip` in every script below to the"
" NIC name and IP address of the current node before starting the service."
msgstr "在开始之前，请将下面每个脚本中的 `nic_name` 和 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的网卡名称和 IP 地址，然后再启动服务。"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node. The Prefill"
" engines are started directly by `vllm serve` on the Prefill nodes, so this "
"script is not required there."
msgstr ""
"1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`。Prefill 引擎由 Prefill 节点上的 `vllm "
"serve` 直接启动，因此 Prefill 节点上不需要此脚本。"

msgid ""
"2. Prepare the Prefill startup scripts. There are 2 Prefill instances, and "
"each one is a PP2 engine spread across 2 nodes: the master node (`--node-"
"rank 0`) starts the engine and its API server, while the worker node "
"(`--node-rank 1`) joins the same engine with `--headless`. `--master-addr` "
"must point to the master node's service IP so that the worker can join the "
"cross-node process group, and both nodes must use identical model, TP, PP, "
"PCP, and `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` settings. `--port $1` takes the engine "
"port from the first command-line argument of the script, for example `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`."
msgstr ""
"2. 准备 Prefill 启动脚本。共有 2 个 Prefill 实例，每个实例是一个跨 2 个节点分布的 PP2 引擎：主节点（`--node-"
"rank 0`）启动引擎及其 API server，而工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）通过 `--headless` "
"加入同一个引擎。`--master-addr` 必须指向主节点的服务 "
"IP，以便工作节点能够加入跨节点进程组，并且两个节点必须使用相同的模型、TP、PP、PCP 和 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` "
"设置。`--port $1` 从脚本的第一个命令行参数获取引擎端口，例如 `bash run_p_node0.sh 8000`。"

msgid "1. `run_p_node0.sh` on the master node of Prefill instance 1:"
msgstr "1. Prefill 实例 1 主节点上的 `run_p_node0.sh`："

msgid ""
"2. `run_p_node1.sh` on the worker node of Prefill instance 1: use the same "
"content as Prefill node 0 with these changes: set `local_ip` to the IP of "
"this node, keep `node0_ip` as the master node's service IP, change `--node-"
"rank` to `1`, and append `--headless` to `vllm serve` so that this node runs"
" only its PP stage without starting an API server."
msgstr ""
"2. Prefill 实例 1 工作节点上的 `run_p_node1.sh`：使用与 Prefill 节点 0 相同的内容，但需做以下修改：将 "
"`local_ip` 设置为本节点的 IP，保持 `node0_ip` 为主节点的服务 IP，将 `--node-rank` 改为 `1`，并在 "
"`vllm serve` 后追加 `--headless`，使该节点仅运行其 PP stage 而不启动 API server。"

msgid ""
"3. Prefill instance 2: prepare `run_p_node2.sh` (master node) and "
"`run_p_node3.sh` (worker node) the same way, with these changes: set "
"`local_ip` to the IP of each node, set `node0_ip` to this instance's own "
"master node IP, and assign a unique `kv_port`, for example "
"`\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`. Keep all other settings identical so that both "
"Prefill instances present the same `prefill` topology to the Decode pool."
msgstr ""
"3. Prefill 实例 2：以相同方式准备 `run_p_node2.sh`（主节点）和 "
"`run_p_node3.sh`（工作节点），但需做以下修改：将 `local_ip` 设置为各节点的 IP，将 `node0_ip` "
"设置为此实例自身的主节点 IP，并分配唯一的 `kv_port`，例如 `\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`。保持所有其他设置一致，以便两个 "
"Prefill 实例向 Decode pool 呈现相同的 `prefill` 拓扑。"

msgid ""
"3. Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode node. `launch_online_dp.py` "
"passes the visible devices, port, DP size, DP rank, DP address, DP RPC port,"
" and TP size as `$1` through `$7`."
msgstr ""
"3. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`。`launch_online_dp.py` 将可见设备、端口、DP "
"大小、DP rank、DP 地址、DP RPC 端口和 TP 大小作为 `$1` 到 `$7` 传入。"

msgid ""
"4. Start the service. Set `local_ip` in every script to the IP of the "
"current node before starting. For each Prefill instance, start the master "
"node (`--node-rank 0`) before its worker node. The first argument is the "
"engine port passed to `--port $1`."
msgstr ""
"4. 启动服务。启动前，请将每个脚本中的 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP。对于每个 Prefill 实例，先启动主节点（`--node-"
"rank 0`），再启动其工作节点。第一个参数是传递给 `--port $1` 的引擎端口。"

msgid "1. Prefill instance 1, master node:"
msgstr "1. Prefill 实例 1，主节点："

msgid "2. Prefill instance 1, worker node (headless):"
msgstr "2. Prefill 实例 1，工作节点（headless）："

msgid "3. Prefill instance 2, master node:"
msgstr "3. Prefill 实例 2，主节点："

msgid "4. Prefill instance 2, worker node (headless):"
msgstr "4. Prefill 实例 2，工作节点（headless）："

msgid ""
"Refer to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and "
"register all Prefill and Decode engine endpoints started above. Each Prefill"
" instance exposes one API server on port `8000` of its master node, and each"
" Decode node exposes ports `8000` through `8007`. Use the DP master address "
"(`--dp-address` above, e.g. `xx.xx.xx.5`) as the IP of Decode node 0."
msgstr ""
"请参考 [Prefill-Decode "
"分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，注册上面启动的所有"
" Prefill 和 Decode 引擎端点。每个 Prefill 实例在其主节点的 `8000` 端口上暴露一个 API server，每个 "
"Decode 节点暴露 `8000` 到 `8007` 端口。使用 DP 主地址（上面的 `--dp-address`，例如 "
"`xx.xx.xx.5`）作为 Decode 节点 0 的 IP。"

msgid "For the Ascend 950DT products in Section 5.2.3, additionally:"
msgstr "对于第 5.2.3 节中的 Ascend 950DT系列产品，还需额外执行以下操作："

msgid ""
"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`: each Prefill instance is a single `DP1/TP1/PP2` engine distributed over 2 nodes (`--nnodes 2`), with one PP stage per node; prefill context parallel further splits long-context computation across the 8 NPUs of each PP stage. The worker node of each instance (`--node-rank 1`) runs headless. `--master-addr` is the service IP of the instance's master node and is required for the cross-node process group.\n"
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"32,29\"` partitions the 61 target layers into 32/29 across the 2 PP stages. The same partition must be declared in `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pp_layer_partition` so that the Decode side lays out KV cache consistently.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution for the Prefill target model on 950DT products; graph compilation is only used on Decode (`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`).\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` use FP8 KV cache on both sides. The P and D sides must use the same KV data types so that the transferred KV cache is directly reusable.\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2: 0` disables the Fused MC2 fusion operator on Prefill; `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` overlaps shared-expert computation with MoE communication instead, and `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` places shared experts on DP ranks.\n"
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` enables the extended NPU graph mode on Decode; `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps dynamic kernels, which is required for the speculative decode shapes used here.\n"
"- `combine_quant_mode: 4` forces the MoE MC2 combine stage on Decode nodes to use FP8 (MXFP float8_e4m3) communication quantization."
msgstr ""
"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`：每个 Prefill 实例是一个 `DP1/TP1/PP2` 引擎，分布在 2 个节点上（`--nnodes 2`），每个节点一个 PP stage；prefill context parallel 进一步将长上下文计算拆分到每个 PP stage 的 8 个 NPU 上。每个实例的工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）以无头模式运行。`--master-addr` 是该实例主节点的服务 IP，跨节点进程组需要用到它。\n"
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"32,29\"` 将 61 个目标层按 32/29 划分到 2 个 PP stage 上。必须在 `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pp_layer_partition` 中声明相同的划分，以便 Decode 侧以一致的方式布局 KV cache。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上强制 Prefill 目标模型以 eager 模式执行；图编译仅在 Decode 上使用（`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`）。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 和 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 在两侧均使用 FP8 KV cache。P 侧和 D 侧必须使用相同的 KV 数据类型，以便传输的 KV cache 可直接复用。\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2: 0` 在 Prefill 上禁用 Fused MC2 融合算子；`multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 改为将共享专家计算与 MoE 通信重叠，`enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 将共享专家放置在 DP rank 上。\n"
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` 在 Decode 上启用扩展 NPU 图模式；`enable_static_kernel: false` 保留动态 kernel，这是此处使用的投机解码形状所必需的。\n"
"- `combine_quant_mode: 4` 强制 Decode 节点上的 MoE MC2 combine 阶段使用 FP8（MXFP float8_e4m3）通信量化。"

msgid ""
"| Short Sequence / High Throughput | 1P1D deployment (2 Prefill + 2 Decode "
"A3 nodes) | 64 (A3) | DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | Prefill uses "
"DP1/TP2/PP2/PCP8 with 16 sequences, while Decode uses DP16/TP2/PP1/PCP1 with"
" 30 sequences and 180 batched tokens. Enable Fused MC2 on Prefill to "
"prioritize throughput. |"
msgstr ""
"| 短序列 / 高吞吐 | 1P1D 部署（2 个 Prefill + 2 个 Decode A3 节点） | 64（A3） | "
"DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | Prefill 使用 DP1/TP2/PP2/PCP8，16 个序列；Decode 使用 "
"DP16/TP2/PP1/PCP1，30 个序列和 180 个批处理 token。在 Prefill 上启用 Fused MC2 以优先保证吞吐。 |"

msgid ""
"| Long Context (~1M Input) | 2P1D deployment (4 Prefill + 4 Decode Ascend "
"950DT nodes; each Prefill instance spans 2 nodes) | 64 (Ascend 950DT) | "
"DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 | Run 2 Prefill instances, each a DP1/TP1/PP2 engine "
"with prefill context parallel (PCP8) over 2 nodes, and one Decode pool with "
"DP32/TP1. |"
msgstr ""
"| 长上下文（约 1M 输入） | 2P1D 部署（4 个 Prefill + 4 个 Decode Ascend 950DT 节点；每个 "
"Prefill 实例跨 2 个节点） | 64（Ascend 950DT） | DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 | 运行 2 个 "
"Prefill 实例，每个实例是一个 DP1/TP1/PP2 引擎，跨 2 个节点使用 prefill context "
"parallel（PCP8），以及一个 DP32/TP1 的 Decode 池。 |"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Configuration | NPUs | TP | DP | Max Num Seqs | Max Num Batched"
" Tokens | Max Model Len | DSpark Speculation Num | Fused MC2 | EP Switch | "
"FC | DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2) |"
msgstr ""
"| 场景 | 配置 | NPU 数 | TP | DP | 最大序列数 | 最大批处理 token 数 | 最大模型长度 | DSpark 投机数 | "
"Fused MC2 | EP 开关 | FC | DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2) |"

msgid ""
"> `FC` reports the FlashComm1.\n"
">\n"
"> `DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2)` describes context parallelism according to the model runner version: MRv1 uses the `enable_dsa_cp` switch, while MRv2 uses `--prefill-context-parallel-size` to specify the PCP size. `PCP=8` means eight-way context parallelism; `PCP=1` means no context parallelism. For the long-context Prefill reference, enable FlashComm1 and disable context parallelism (`enable_dsa_cp: false` on MRv1, or PCP size `1` on MRv2). The long-context example for 950DT products runs on the V2 model runner and uses `PCP=8` on Prefill; `enable_dsa_cp` is mutually exclusive with PCP and must stay off there.\n"
">\n"
"> Fused MC2 is disabled in the long-context reference configuration because it increases memory usage. If sufficient memory is available and higher performance is the priority, enabling Fused MC2 on Prefill is recommended.\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576` is the total context budget for prompt and generated tokens, not an additional output budget on top of a 1M-token prompt. Reduce `--max-num-seqs` or the actual input length if memory is insufficient.\n"
">\n"
"> For complete startup commands and parameter descriptions, please refer to the deployment examples in [Chapter 5](#5-online-service-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"> `FC` 表示 FlashComm1。\n"
">\n"
"> `DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2)` 根据 model runner 版本描述上下文并行：MRv1 使用 `enable_dsa_cp` 开关，而 MRv2 使用 `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 指定 PCP 大小。`PCP=8` 表示八路上下文并行；`PCP=1` 表示不启用上下文并行。对于长上下文 Prefill 参考配置，启用 FlashComm1 并禁用上下文并行（MRv1 上设置 `enable_dsa_cp: false`，或 MRv2 上 PCP 大小设为 `1`）。Ascend 950DT系列产品的长上下文示例运行在 V2 model runner 上，并在 Prefill 上使用 `PCP=8`；`enable_dsa_cp` 与 PCP 互斥，因此在那里必须保持关闭。\n"
">\n"
"> 长上下文参考配置中禁用了 Fused MC2，因为它会增加内存占用。如果内存充足且优先考虑更高性能，建议在 Prefill 上启用 Fused MC2。\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576` 是 prompt 和生成 token 的总上下文预算，而不是在 1M token prompt 之上额外的输出预算。如果内存不足，请减小 `--max-num-seqs` 或实际输入长度。\n"
">\n"
"> 完整的启动命令和参数说明，请参考[第 5 章](#5-online-service-deployment)中的部署示例。"

msgid ""
"A: For 950PR&950DT products, the W4A4C8 weights of `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` "
"are quantized with "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_pro_w4a4c8.yaml)."
" To preserve accuracy at such a low bit-width, a mixed-precision strategy is"
" used: only the modules that dominate the parameter count are quantized to 4"
" bit, while precision-sensitive modules fall back to higher precision or are"
" not quantized at all."
msgstr ""
"答：对于 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 的 W4A4C8 权重使用 "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_pro_w4a4c8.yaml)"
" 进行量化。为了在如此低的位宽下保持精度，采用了混合精度策略：仅将参数数量占主导的模块量化为 4 bit，而对精度敏感的模块回退到更高精度或完全不量化。"

msgid ""
"- **Quantization algorithm**: The weights and activations use the MXFP4/MXFP8 microscaling formats. Each tensor is divided into blocks of 32 elements, and each block shares a single scaling factor obtained with symmetric min-max calibration on a mixed calibration dataset. Block-wise scaling adapts to the local dynamic range of each tensor, so the quantization error is far lower than that of uniform INT4 quantization.\n"
"- **C8 (FP8 KV cache)**: C8 is a dynamic quantization applied to the KV cache during inference. On 950PR&950DT products, the KV cache is quantized to FP8 (not INT8). It is unrelated to the parameters stored in the weight checkpoint and is controlled only by the serving configuration. DeepSeek-V4-Flash and DeepSeek-V4-Pro share exactly the same C8 scheme:\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache** (FP8 by default on 950PR&950DT products; switch back to BF16 with `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16`): the compressed KV latent, which serves as both K and V, is dynamically quantized per 64-element tile to FP8 (E4M3) with a shared E8M0 scale per tile; the RoPE part of the KV cache stays in BF16, and Q is not quantized.\n"
"    - **Indexer cache** (enabled with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`): both indexer Q and K are first rotated by a Hadamard matrix to spread outliers, and then dynamically quantized per token to FP8 (E4M3) with per-token FP32 scales."
msgstr ""
"- **量化算法**：权重和激活使用 MXFP4/MXFP8 微缩放格式。每个张量被划分为 32 个元素的块，每个块共享一个缩放因子，该因子通过在混合校准数据集上进行对称 min-max 校准获得。逐块缩放可适应每个张量的局部动态范围，因此量化误差远低于均匀 INT4 量化。\n"
"- **C8（FP8 KV cache）**：C8 是在推理过程中对 KV cache 应用的动态量化。在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，KV cache 被量化为 FP8（而非 INT8）。它与权重 checkpoint 中存储的参数无关，仅由服务配置控制。DeepSeek-V4-Flash 和 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 共享完全相同的 C8 方案：\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache**（在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上默认为 FP8；可通过 `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16` 切换回 BF16）：作为 K 和 V 的压缩 KV latent，按 64 元素 tile 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），每个 tile 共享一个 E8M0 缩放因子；KV cache 的 RoPE 部分保持 BF16，Q 不量化。\n"
"    - **Indexer cache**（通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用）：indexer 的 Q 和 K 首先通过 Hadamard 矩阵旋转以分散离群值，然后按 token 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），并使用逐 token 的 FP32 缩放因子。"
